Design-systems library — local working library, provenance recorded
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Source: tools/ux-ui-agent-skills/design-systems/library/ (138 systems, each with
        a DESIGN.md), used locally and not redistributed.

Provenance: the v1 theme names paper, editorial, cosmic and agentic match systems
in that library; night (dark warm) does not exist there and is derived from
warm-editorial plus a dark neutral base, as stated in docs/DESIGN.md. The product
ships its own token values, not the library files.

