OpenCode — MIT License — format provenance only
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Source: the owner's live ~/.config/opencode/opencode.json and
        projects/AGGG-4.0/opencode.json, both read read-only; and
        tools/upstream/opencode-gaslight/, read as a reference.

Used for the on-disk shape of the MCP server list (mcp.<name> with
type: local|remote, command/url, enabled, environment) and for reference on agent
loop and TUI techniques. No OpenCode code was copied verbatim: the reader, the
writer and the errors in Oneiro are its own, and it never writes into another
client's configuration. No licence obligation arises; recorded here as format
provenance.

