Hermes — conventions only
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Source: the owner's ~/.config/hermes/config.yaml and cron directory, outside this
        repository and read only for the conventions named in docs/DECISIONS-v1.md § 1.2.

Taken: the settings vocabulary (base_url, key_env, discover_models, models), the
idea of fallback_providers and agent.max_turns, and the cron-like job record as
the model for oneiro/schedule.py. Hermes runtime state is neither read nor
written by the product, and no Hermes code was copied verbatim. No licence
obligation arises; recorded here as convention provenance.

